cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SteeringArabicDialects"
abstract: >
  Code for the paper "Can Dialects Be Steered Like Languages?
  Sparse Neurons and Distributed Directions in Arabic LLMs".
  Implements neuron steering (LAPE-based MLP neuron identification
  and rescaling) and vector steering (mean activation-difference
  injection) for Arabic dialect control in LLMs.
